# Requests for the local API, for the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client):
# click "Send Request" above one. Start the API first (make api, or "API (debug)").
#
# The login comes from apps/api/.env (gitignored), for example the e2e account:
#   HTTP_LOGIN_EMAIL=e2e-owner@example.com
#   HTTP_LOGIN_PASSWORD=e2e correct horse battery

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000
@email = {{$dotenv HTTP_LOGIN_EMAIL}}
@password = {{$dotenv HTTP_LOGIN_PASSWORD}}

### Is the API up?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/ready

### Log in (the token is reused below)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Who am I?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### My devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Log out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
